/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/6d00acef-a778-40bb-bfdc-f72787d0168f/alternate/1790360789805-zafir-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"","era":"","name":"Zafir","race":"Half-Genie / Half-Human","alias":"The Infinite Conjurer","gender":"Male","titles":"Wild Card","subrace":"Half-Genie","summary":"Zafir is a Half-Genie and Half-Human Sunspear whose impossible birth was made possible by his mother''s Great Wish. His father''s entire Genie essence was woven into Zafir''s soul to sustain his existence. Charismatic, theatrical, and effortlessly confident, Zafir travels with Kaelen''s crew while searching for the Lamp of the First Djinn and a way to separate his father''s essence from his own.","heritage":"Sunspear","homeland":"Shifting Sands","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"Conjurer","affiliation":"Kaelen''s Crew","apparentAge":"Early 20s","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Extreme magical versatility\nAerial mobility\nMatter alteration\nPhysical evasion\nTangible conjuration\nDesert navigation\nSocial manipulation","weaknesses":"Severe post-wish exhaustion\nVulnerability after granting wishes","combatStyle":["Aerial combat","Sunspear combat","Reality manipulation","Transmutation","Conjured weapons","Evasive combat"],"limitations":["One wish per person per lifetime","Cannot grant his own wishes","Wish granting drains Chronoessence"],"powerSource":["Genie essence","Internal Chronoessence"],"abilityNotes":"Zafir''s magic is internal rather than drawn from an external Chronoessence source. His conjurations emerge through mint-blue mist accompanied by the scent of jasmine and ozone. His One-Wish Rule allows him to grant one wish to each person during that person''s lifetime, but fulfilling a wish severely depletes his Chronoessence and can leave him vulnerable for several days.","combatProfile":"Zafir fights from the air whenever possible, using mobility and unpredictability rather than remaining in direct exchanges. He alters matter, creates tangible phantasms, and shifts into mist to evade attacks. His Sunspear training gives him a grounded combat foundation when magic is unavailable.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Mist Form\nMiniature Form\nShapeshifted Forms","primaryAbilities":"Conjuration\nTransmutation\nMaterial Manipulation\nPhantasm Creation\nIntangibility\nFlight","secondaryAbilities":"Shapeshifting\nMiniaturization\nMist Transformation\nDesert Hazard Sensing\nTemporal Dust Detection","signatureTechniques":"One-Wish Rule\nHard-Light Conjuration\nMist Form\nMiniature Form","transformationDetails":"Zafir can dissolve his physical body into a gaseous mist capable of bypassing barriers and physical attacks. He can also transmute himself into animals, other people, or a miniature version of himself while retaining his personality and magical nature."},"is_public":false,"appearance":{"build":["Short","Lean","Athletic"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"5''4\"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Golden amber"],"grooming":"Well-groomed","skinTone":["Warm bronze"],"wardrobe":"Sleeveless embroidered vests\nHarem pants\nRoyal Sunspear silks\nFlowing waist fabrics","hairColor":["Mint-blue"],"hairStyle":"Voluminous gravity-defying waves","accessories":"Gold bangles\nJeweled waist-cinch\nSapphire earring\nGold necklace","faceDetails":["Sharp features","Handsome face","Almond-shaped eyes"],"hairTexture":["Thick"],"colorPalette":"Mint Blue\nCerulean\nSilver\nTeal\nGold\nWarm Bronze","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Teal\nGold\nBlack\nWhite","alternateForm":["Mist Form","Miniature Form"],"clothingStyle":"Opulent Sunspear clothing designed for unrestricted movement and aerial poses. Open-chested garments deliberately leave his Genie markings visible.","appearanceNotes":"Zafir''s blue markings extend from the crown of his head to the soles of his feet and pulse when he channels magic. His hair and loose fabrics subtly drift as though suspended underwater. He commonly hovers several inches above the ground, making his short stature less immediately apparent.","outfitMaterials":["Silk","Gold embroidery","Sheer fabric"],"postureMovement":["Persistent hovering","Fluid movement","Weightless movement","Relaxed floating poses"],"signatureOutfit":"A short sleeveless embroidered vest worn over a bare chest with high-waisted teal harem pants, gold jewelry, and flowing Sunspear fabrics.","distinguishingFeatures":["Glowing blue Genie markings"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T17:24:34.742151+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T18:26:47.68714+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["Losing his father permanently","Being exploited as an artifact","Losing his identity","Having his wishes abused"],"goals":["Find the Lamp of the First Djinn","Untangle his father''s essence","Meet his father","Understand the Shifting Sands"],"beliefs":["Wishes should carry meaning","Greed destroys people","Freedom is essential","Sacrifice gives wishes value"],"culture":["Sunspear","Navigator"],"lineage":"Sunspear","storyArc":"Zafir''s search for the Lamp of the First Djinn forces him to confront whether becoming whole requires separating himself from the father whose essence helped create him. His journey through the Shifting Sands becomes both a search for his father and an exploration of his own identity.","backstory":"Genies normally cannot reproduce with mortals. Zafir''s mother used her final Great Wish to conceive a child with the Genie she loved. The wish required Zafir''s father''s entire essence to be woven into Zafir, leaving the boy carrying both his own soul and his father''s essence. Zafir eventually began searching for the Lamp of the First Djinn in hopes of untangling them.","childhood":"Zafir was raised by his mother in a village of Master Navigators within the Shifting Sands. He learned Sunspear combat, star-mapping, desert survival, and how to read signs associated with Gaius and Ruchika. His unusual Genie traits made him both valuable to the village and a target for Desert Raiders.","lifestyle":["Prefers hovering to walking","Enjoys social settings","Explores ancient ruins","Searches magical nexuses","Avoids unnecessary physical labor"],"storyRole":"Zafir serves as the charismatic wild card of Kaelen''s crew. His reality-warping abilities provide extraordinary versatility, while his knowledge of the Shifting Sands makes him essential when the crew enters Genie territory.","birthplace":"Shifting Sands","psychology":["Feels divided between two identities","Masks insecurity with confidence","Values personal freedom","Distrusts greed","Protective of his wish magic"],"motivations":["Understand his Genie heritage","Restore his father","Protect his autonomy","Prevent misuse of wishes"],"personality":["Charismatic","Confident","Enigmatic","Romantic","Playful","Witty","Theatrical","Selective","Stylish","Detached"],"voiceSpeech":["Speaks in third person","Smooth delivery","Playful teasing","Elegant phrasing","Slightly theatrical"],"likesDislikes":["Beautiful things","Stories","Teasing Sax","Jasmine","Stargazing","Greed","Confinement","Being underestimated","Wasted wishes"],"majorLifeEvents":"Born through the Great Wish\nFather''s essence merged with his soul\nRaised among the Master Navigators\nBecame a Navigator scout\nTargeted by Desert Raiders\nJoined Kaelen''s Crew\nBegan searching for the First Djinn''s Lamp"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/6d00acef-a778-40bb-bfdc-f72787d0168f/portrait/1790360764956-zafir-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"Kaelen\nSax","rivals":"Sax","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"","worldConnections":"Shifting Sands\nShifting Citadel\nLamp of the First Djinn","relationshipNotes":"Zafir''s unnamed Genie father sacrificed his separate existence during the Great Wish that created Zafir, leaving his essence woven into Zafir''s soul. His unnamed Sunspear mother raised him among the Navigators and taught him the story of his father''s sacrifice. Zafir shares a playful rivalry with Sax and frequently provokes him through teasing and effortless displays of magic."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"0b60f4e0-6962-403f-9129-83fba60ab268","realm_record_id":"48066562-cd1c-4b72-8c29-399594efad38","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"5390053d-91ee-4046-943f-d8008e4d5d0e","faction_record_id":"f5492e8b-d617-44b1-bce7-517c90d1da55"}', '2026-09-25 18:27:12.7841+00');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO studio_revisions (id, entity_type, entity_id, entity_label, changed_by, changed_by_email, snapshot, created_at) VALUES ('f14eff0b-9c6c-4a58-ae45-495f7b60fa80', 'studio_characters', '5de8dc77-a4f2-4117-8c92-105cfd9b2cd8', 'Lord Corvin Sterling', 'db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745', 'Bryannaparker2521@gmail.com', '{"id":"5de8dc77-a4f2-4117-8c92-105cfd9b2cd8","name":"Lord Corvin Sterling","media":{"tbdFields":"","canonLocks":"Warm amber eyes\nDark brown hair\nShort practical hairstyle\nThin build\n5''11\" height\nSoft jawline\nSlightly tired eyes\nThin lips\nPractical noble attire\nGlasses\nLeather gloves","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/5de8dc77-a4f2-4117-8c92-105cfd9b2cd8/portrait/1790360678101-corvin-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done","productionNotes":"Anime-style visual design. Preserve his understated appearance, thin build, short dark brown hair, warm amber eyes, practical noble clothing, glasses, leather gloves, and Beast Tamer accessories.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/5de8dc77-a4f2-4117-8c92-105cfd9b2cd8/reference/1790360695453-corvin-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/5de8dc77-a4f2-4117-8c92-105cfd9b2cd8/alternate/1790360714190-corvin-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"Mid to late 30s","era":"","name":"Lord Corvin Sterling","race":"","alias":"The Man Who Forgets Nothing","gender":"Male","titles":"Intelligence Master","subrace":"","summary":"An unassuming intelligence master whose perfect memory and exceptional observational skills make him quietly formidable. Corvin rarely commands attention; instead, he absorbs everything around him. His calm demeanor contrasts with the unsettling realization that he remembers nearly everything he sees and hears.","heritage":"","homeland":"","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"Intelligence Master","affiliation":"","apparentAge":"","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Perfect recall\nExceptional observation\nBehavioral analysis\nAnimal affinity\nInformation retention","weaknesses":"","combatStyle":"","limitations":"","powerSource":"","abilityNotes":"Perfect Memory Recall allows Corvin to retain extraordinary amounts of observed and spoken information. His attention to microexpressions, inconsistencies, and breathing patterns makes even ordinary conversations valuable sources of intelligence. His Beast Tamer affinity creates an unusually strong rapport with animals.","combatProfile":"","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"","primaryAbilities":"Perfect Memory Recall\nBeast Taming","secondaryAbilities":"Microexpression Reading\nBehavioral Observation\nInconsistency Detection\nBreathing Pattern Analysis","signatureTechniques":"","transformationDetails":""},"is_public":false,"appearance":{"build":["Thin"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"5''11\"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Warm amber"],"grooming":"Practical","skinTone":["Fair"],"wardrobe":"Practical noble attire\nLayered clothing\nTravel cloaks","hairColor":["Dark brown"],"hairStyle":"Short and practical","accessories":"Glasses\nLeather gloves\nWhistles\nCarved animal tokens","faceDetails":["Soft jawline","Slightly tired eyes","Thin lips","Understatedly handsome"],"hairTexture":"","colorPalette":"","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"","alternateForm":"","clothingStyle":"Functional noble clothing designed for travel, observation, and discreet storage rather than display.","appearanceNotes":"Corvin looks surprisingly ordinary and does not naturally command attention. His warm eyes initially appear comforting, but prolonged eye contact becomes unsettling once his flawless recall and observational ability are understood.","outfitMaterials":["Leather"],"postureMovement":["Unassuming","Quiet","Observant"],"signatureOutfit":"Layered practical noble attire with a travel cloak, leather gloves, concealed pockets, and glasses when reviewing reports.","distinguishingFeatures":""},"created_at":"2026-09-25T17:30:40.358267+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T18:25:24.976996+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":"","beliefs":"","culture":"","lineage":"","storyArc":"","backstory":"","childhood":"","lifestyle":"","storyRole":"Corvin serves as an intelligence specialist whose extraordinary memory allows him to retain conversations, behaviors, inconsistencies, and subtle details others overlook.","birthplace":"","psychology":["Highly perceptive","Constantly observant","Detail-oriented"],"motivations":"","personality":["Calm","Reserved","Observant","Patient","Quiet","Analytical"],"voiceSpeech":["Soft-spoken","Controlled","Rarely raises his voice"],"likesDislikes":["Animals"],"majorLifeEvents":""},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/5de8dc77-a4f2-4117-8c92-105cfd9b2cd8/portrait/1790360678101-corvin-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"","worldConnections":"","relationshipNotes":""},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":null,"realm_record_id":null,"workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":null,"faction_record_id":null}', '2026-09-25 18:27:13.755287+00');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO studio_revisions (id, entity_type, entity_id, entity_label, changed_by, changed_by_email, snapshot, created_at) VALUES ('f21793a4-de19-4e96-9a24-ff9a4f79f619', 'studio_characters', '74fd4dac-0364-45fd-9aae-2e363ac3706d', 'Silas', 'db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745', 'Bryannaparker2521@gmail.com', '{"id":"74fd4dac-0364-45fd-9aae-2e363ac3706d","name":"Silas","media":{"tbdFields":"Age\nWeight\nDominant hand\nBirth date\nParents'' names\nBrother''s name\nWife''s name\nDaughter''s name","canonLocks":"Human\nDeep ebony skin\nLilac eyes\nBlack 4C hair\nSubtle undercut\nFull beard\nThin connected mustache\nThick arched eyebrows\nVoodoo-style tattoos\n6''4\" height\nMuscular build\nBone adornments\nFeather adornments\nAnimal-hide clothing\nHumorous public persona\nGloomy private persona","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"The smiling Silas reference represents the protective persona he commonly presents around Sax. The darker full-body reference represents the grief, fury, and psychological instability beneath that persona.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/74fd4dac-0364-45fd-9aae-2e363ac3706d/portrait/1790360616164-silas-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nAlternate Mood Reference — Done\nSilas and Sax Reference — Done","productionNotes":"Maintain the contrast between Silas''s public persona and his private emotional state. His familiar design should feel warm, charismatic, witty, and slightly mischievous. When the emotional mask drops, preserve the same face and design while replacing the smile with a dark blank stare, severe frown, visible rage, disorientation, and a gloomy aura.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/74fd4dac-0364-45fd-9aae-2e363ac3706d/reference/1790360624556-silas-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/74fd4dac-0364-45fd-9aae-2e363ac3706d/alternate/1790360632228-silas-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"","era":"","name":"Silas","race":"Human","alias":"","gender":"Male","titles":"Grand Voodoo Priest","subrace":"","summary":"Silas is the Grand Voodoo Priest of Moonwood Vail and a master of ancestral magic, spiritual crossroads, and curse-weaving. Beneath his witty, carefree persona is a deeply wounded survivor whose family was slaughtered during Captain Blackheart''s pirate raid. He raises and trains his surviving nephew, Sax, while guarding the balance between the physical and spiritual realms. He later becomes a mentor to Kaelen, teaching him spiritual grounding techniques capable of stabilizing Umbral Genesis.","heritage":"","homeland":"Moonwood Vail","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"Grand Voodoo Priest","affiliation":"","apparentAge":"40s","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Moonwood Vail","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Exceptional spiritual mastery\nAdvanced curse control\nAncestor communication\nCrossroads manipulation\nSpiritual defense\nExperienced mentorship","weaknesses":"Unresolved grief\nSuppressed rage\nProtectiveness toward Sax","combatStyle":["Tactical","Ritual-based","Binding-focused","Curse-based","Spirit-assisted"],"limitations":["Spiritual balance must be maintained"],"powerSource":["Chronoessence","Ancestor spirits","Loa","Spiritual crossroads"],"abilityNotes":"Voodoo in Aethelgard draws upon Chronoessence, ancestral spirits, Loa, nature, and places where the veil between realms is thin. Silas''s mastery makes him capable of maintaining spiritual equilibrium and opposing corruption such as the Shadow Blight. These same principles allow him to teach Kaelen structured spiritual methods for containing and grounding Umbral Genesis.","combatProfile":"Silas approaches conflict through control rather than simple destructive force. He uses spirits, curses, bindings, redirection, and manipulation of spiritual connections to weaken or neutralize opponents. His experience with the crossroads allows him to fight threats that operate across physical and spiritual boundaries.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"","primaryAbilities":"Ancestor Magic\nSpirit Communion\nCrossroads Magic\nCurse-Weaving\nChronoessence Manipulation","secondaryAbilities":"Spirit Invocation\nSpiritual Binding\nCurse Redirection\nSpiritual Cleansing\nGris-Gris Creation\nRitual Magic\nSpiritual Protection","signatureTechniques":"Ancestor Communion\nCrossroads Invocation\nSpiritual Grounding\nCurse Binding\nCurse Redirection","transformationDetails":""},"is_public":false,"appearance":{"build":["Tall","Muscular","Broad-shouldered"],"nails":"","eyeHex":["Lilac — #B47AE8"],"height":"6''4\"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":["Black — #111013"],"skinHex":["Deep Ebony — #3A2119"],"eyeColor":["Lilac"],"grooming":"Well-kept beard","skinTone":["Deep ebony"],"wardrobe":"Ritual robes\nLeather wraps\nLayered trousers\nLaced sandals","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Long curls with a subtle undercut","accessories":"Bone necklaces\nFeather charms\nBeaded bracelets\nGris-gris charms\nRitual talismans","faceDetails":["Handsome angular face","Thick arched eyebrows","Full beard","Thin connected mustache"],"hairTexture":["4C","Curly"],"colorPalette":"Black — #111013\nDeep Brown — #3A2119\nLilac — #B47AE8\nBone Ivory — #D8C9AA\nDark Purple — #4A284F\nSpirit Green — #72C66A","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Black\nDark brown\nDeep purple\nBone ivory","alternateForm":"","clothingStyle":"Ancient spiritual attire combining practical wilderness clothing with ritual adornments. Bones, feathers, animal hides, beads, and intricate lacing visually reflect his connection to ancestral traditions and the spiritual crossroads.","appearanceNotes":"Silas normally presents himself with an easy, goofy smile that reinforces his relaxed and humorous persona. When that mask drops, his expression becomes gloomy and severe, with a blank stare, deep frown, visible rage, and an almost unhinged intensity revealing grief he has never completely healed from.","outfitMaterials":["Animal hide","Leather","Bone","Feathers","Beads","Woven cloth"],"postureMovement":["Relaxed","Confident","Intimidating when serious"],"signatureOutfit":"Layered dark ritual clothing with an open chest, intricate lacing, animal hides, bone adornments, feathers, beads, wraps, and weathered fabric.","distinguishingFeatures":["Voodoo-style tattoos"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T17:31:02.583952+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T18:23:56.48297+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["Losing Sax","Failing his family again","Spiritual imbalance","Shadow Blight corruption"],"goals":["Prepare Sax as a successor","Ground Kaelen''s power","Protect Moonwood Vail","Preserve spiritual equilibrium"],"beliefs":["Ancestor veneration","Harmony with spirits","Balance between realms","Chronoessence connects existence","Spiritual power requires responsibility"],"culture":["Moonwood Vail","Voodoo tradition"],"lineage":"","storyArc":"Silas''s outward humor conceals grief and rage that never fully disappeared after his family''s massacre. His relationship with Sax gives him a reason to remain emotionally connected to the living instead of surrendering himself completely to vengeance. Through mentoring Sax and Kaelen, his role evolves from survivor seeking strength into a guardian responsible for passing that strength forward.","backstory":"Silas eventually married and had a daughter while his brother married and had Sax. At thirty-one, Silas remained home reading while his family went out together. Captain Blackheart''s pirates attacked while searching for a powerful vampire relic and slaughtered Silas''s family. Silas discovered one-year-old Sax alive beneath his mother''s body. Consumed by grief and the need to protect his nephew, Silas devoted himself to Voodoo and eventually rose to become the Grand Voodoo Priest.","childhood":"Silas grew up in the slums of Moonwood Vail with his younger brother and their struggling mother. At thirteen, Silas and his ten-year-old brother vowed to escape poverty and give their mother a better life. Through years of odd jobs and saving, they moved her into a small cottage when Silas was seventeen.","lifestyle":["Spiritual training","Ancestor communion","Ritual practice","Mentoring","Crossroads guardianship"],"storyRole":"Silas serves as a major mentor and spiritual anchor within The Chronicles of Umbra. His mastery of Voodoo allows him to bridge the living world, ancestral realms, and the deeper forces surrounding Chronoessence. His knowledge becomes especially important when he begins teaching Kaelen how to ground the unstable power of Umbral Genesis.","birthplace":"Moonwood Vail","psychology":["Unresolved grief","Suppressed rage","Survivor''s guilt","Protective attachment to Sax","Humor masks emotional pain"],"motivations":["Protect Sax","Honor his family","Maintain spiritual balance","Defend the crossroads","Oppose the Shadow Blight","Avenge his family"],"personality":["Witty","Funny","Carefree","Protective","Strict","Demanding","Resilient","Vengeful"],"voiceSpeech":["Relaxed humor","Playful teasing","Strict teaching voice","Serious when necessary"],"likesDislikes":["Reading","Humor","Spiritual study","Protecting Sax","Pirates"],"majorLifeEvents":"Raised in Moonwood Vail slums\nVowed to escape poverty at thirteen\nMoved his mother from the slums\nMarried and became a father\nCaptain Blackheart''s pirate raid\nFound Sax alive after the massacre\nDevoted himself to Voodoo training\nBecame Grand Voodoo Priest\nBegan training Sax\nBegan mentoring Kaelen"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/74fd4dac-0364-45fd-9aae-2e363ac3706d/portrait/1790360616164-silas-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"Sax\nKaelen","rivals":"","enemies":"Captain Blackheart","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"","worldConnections":"Moonwood Vail","relationshipNotes":"Sax is Silas''s nephew and the only surviving member of his immediate family after Captain Blackheart''s raid. Silas raised, protected, and relentlessly trained him with the possibility that Sax may eventually succeed him as Grand Voodoo Priest. Silas later becomes Kaelen''s mentor, teaching him Voodoo principles to ground and contain Umbral Genesis."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"c68d60d1-883a-4683-8000-a9cd9d0d4d2a","realm_record_id":"63782818-208e-4e9b-a57c-9c33daba0589","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":null,"faction_record_id":null}', '2026-09-25 18:27:14.453024+00');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO studio_revisions (id, entity_type, entity_id, entity_label, changed_by, changed_by_email, snapshot, created_at) VALUES ('c368a8d1-20b2-4de3-9d72-0aaab8a757b9', 'studio_characters', 'ccc902c8-99ac-442c-b404-783996e7218e', 'Lord Alistar Vane', 'db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745', 'Bryannaparker2521@gmail.com', '{"id":"ccc902c8-99ac-442c-b404-783996e7218e","name":"Lord Alistar Vane","media":{"tbdFields":"","canonLocks":"Dark auburn hair\nCopper-gold eyes\nMessy tied-back hairstyle\nBroad muscular build\nStrong jaw\nSlightly crooked nose\nWarm smile\nForge goggles\nGolden kinetic runes","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Anime-style visual design established.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/ccc902c8-99ac-442c-b404-783996e7218e/portrait/1790360559565-ailstar-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done","productionNotes":"Preserve his dark auburn tied-back hair, loose face-framing strands, copper-gold eyes, broad muscular build, forge goggles, leather harness, rolled sleeves, reinforced gloves, heavy forge boots, elegant outer coat, and golden kinetic rune effects.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/ccc902c8-99ac-442c-b404-783996e7218e/reference/1790360575346-ailstar-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/ccc902c8-99ac-442c-b404-783996e7218e/alternate/1790360586376-ailstar-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"Mid 30s","era":"","name":"Lord Alistar Vane","race":"","alias":"The Architect of Tomorrow","gender":"Male","titles":"The Technical Forgemaster","subrace":"","summary":"A charismatic and brilliant technical forgemaster whose approachable personality contrasts sharply with the dangerous potential of his inventions. Alistar channels kinetic force through glowing golden runes and approaches creation with infectious enthusiasm.","heritage":"","homeland":"","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"Technical Forgemaster","affiliation":"","apparentAge":"","canonStatus":"","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Technical brilliance\nForging expertise\nInventive engineering\nPhysical strength","weaknesses":"Underestimates invention hazards","combatStyle":"","limitations":"","powerSource":["Kinetic Imbuement"],"abilityNotes":"When Alistar channels kinetic power, golden runes ignite beneath his skin. Nearby tools vibrate, weapons hum, and the surrounding air crackles with restrained force.","combatProfile":"","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"","primaryAbilities":"Kinetic Imbuement","secondaryAbilities":"Kinetic rune manifestation","signatureTechniques":"","transformationDetails":""},"is_public":false,"appearance":{"build":["Broad-shouldered","Muscular arms"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"6''1\"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Copper-gold"],"grooming":"Frequently forgets to brush his hair","skinTone":"","wardrobe":"Elegant coats\nRolled-sleeve shirts\nLeather harnesses\nReinforced gloves\nForge boots","hairColor":["Dark auburn"],"hairStyle":"Messy and usually tied back","accessories":"Forge goggles","faceDetails":["Strong jaw","Slightly crooked nose","Warm smile","Approachable expression"],"hairTexture":"","colorPalette":"","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"","alternateForm":"","clothingStyle":"Noble attire blended with practical workshop clothing.","appearanceNotes":"His bright, intelligent eyes are constantly moving and analyzing. When excited, his copper-gold eyes appear to sparkle.","outfitMaterials":["Leather"],"postureMovement":"","signatureOutfit":"Rolled sleeves, leather harness, reinforced gloves, heavy forge boots, goggles around his neck, and an elegant coat over functional workshop gear.","distinguishingFeatures":["Loose face-framing strands"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T17:32:58.221955+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T18:23:12.233962+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":"","beliefs":"","culture":"","lineage":"","storyArc":"","backstory":"","childhood":"","lifestyle":["Forging","Inventing","Workshop experimentation"],"storyRole":"","birthplace":"","psychology":["Constantly analyzing","Excitable about inventions","Underestimates his creations'' danger"],"motivations":["Innovation","Creation"],"personality":["Charismatic","Friendly","Brilliant","Approachable","Enthusiastic","Inventive","Absent-minded"],"voiceSpeech":"","likesDislikes":["Creating inventions","Technical experimentation"],"majorLifeEvents":""},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/ccc902c8-99ac-442c-b404-783996e7218e/portrait/1790360559565-ailstar-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"","worldConnections":"","relationshipNotes":""},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":null,"realm_record_id":null,"workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":null,"faction_record_id":null}', '2026-09-25 18:27:15.710822+00');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO studio_revisions (id, entity_type, entity_id, entity_label, changed_by, changed_by_email, snapshot, created_at) VALUES ('68fbcfbb-e283-4eff-a020-75a248196518', 'studio_characters', '18527db0-a1c0-4b40-875d-8d911067a94a', 'King Kaelo', 'db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745', 'Bryannaparker2521@gmail.com', '{"id":"18527db0-a1c0-4b40-875d-8d911067a94a","name":"King Kaelo","media":{"tbdFields":"","canonLocks":"Deep mahogany skin\nBlack 4c hair\nMedium-length dreads\nPowerful build\nPure Dire Wolf form\nBlack-and-gold palette\nGolden spiritual aura\nOgou-Style Martial Arts","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/18527db0-a1c0-4b40-875d-8d911067a94a/portrait/1790360382571-king-kaelo-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nAlternate / True Form — Done","productionNotes":"Preserve Kaelo''s deep mahogany skin, black medium-length 4c dreads, powerful build, regal black-and-gold presentation, and pure Dire Wolf transformation. His golden spiritual aura should remain the primary visual language of his combat abilities.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/18527db0-a1c0-4b40-875d-8d911067a94a/reference/1790360398954-king-kaelo-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/18527db0-a1c0-4b40-875d-8d911067a94a/alternate/1790360411311-king-kaelo-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"","era":"","name":"King Kaelo","race":"Werebeast","alias":"The Spiritual Anchor","gender":"Male","titles":"King","subrace":"Dire Wolf","summary":"King Kaelo is the independent ruler of Moonwood Vail and the father of seven formidable werebeast children. A pure Dire Wolf werebeast, he protects his realm through immense physical strength, spiritual discipline, and Ogou-Style Martial Arts. His rule has successfully kept King Vorlag''s tyranny outside Moonwood Vail''s borders.","heritage":"","homeland":"Moonwood Vail","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"King","affiliation":"Moonwood Vail","apparentAge":"","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Moonwood Vail","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Extreme physical strength\nSpiritual discipline\nClose-range combat\nHigh durability\nBattlefield disruption","weaknesses":"","combatStyle":["Ogou-Style Martial Arts","Close-quarters combat","Aura-enhanced striking"],"limitations":"","powerSource":["Spiritual energy","Werebeast physiology"],"abilityNotes":"Kaelo''s golden aura reinforces his strikes with battering-ram force. His projected shockwave can level structures and scatter infantry formations.","combatProfile":"Kaelo fights through Ogou-Style Martial Arts, infusing his physical strikes with iron-hard golden spiritual energy. His blows carry tremendous concussive force, allowing him to overwhelm opponents through disciplined close-range combat rather than relying on conventional weapons. He can also project his accumulated spiritual force outward across the battlefield.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Pure Dire Wolf Form","primaryAbilities":"Golden Aura Manipulation\nSpiritual Energy Projection\nEnhanced Strength\nEnhanced Durability","secondaryAbilities":"Enhanced Speed\nEnhanced Senses\nDire Wolf Transformation","signatureTechniques":"Golden Shockwave","transformationDetails":"Kaelo transforms into a pure Dire Wolf werebeast. The transformation greatly enhances his natural physical power, durability, speed, and predatory capabilities."},"is_public":false,"appearance":{"build":["Tall","Powerful","Athletic"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":"","grooming":"Neatly groomed","skinTone":["Deep mahogany"],"wardrobe":"Royal robes\nCombat attire\nFur mantle","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Medium-length dreads","accessories":"Gold jewelry","faceDetails":["Sharp facial features","Strong jawline"],"hairTexture":["4c"],"colorPalette":"Black\nGold\nMahogany","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Black\nGold","alternateForm":["Pure Dire Wolf"],"clothingStyle":"Regal dark clothing combining royal authority with practical martial attire.","appearanceNotes":"Kaelo has a commanding royal presence with deep mahogany skin, sharp features, and medium-length 4c dreads. His physical design should communicate both disciplined martial strength and the authority of an independent ruler.","outfitMaterials":["Fabric","Leather","Fur","Metal"],"postureMovement":["Commanding","Regal","Grounded"],"signatureOutfit":"Regal black attire with gold detailing and a dark fur mantle.","distinguishingFeatures":""},"created_at":"2026-09-25T17:33:11.861815+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T18:22:26.987894+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":["Maintain Moonwood Vail''s sovereignty"],"beliefs":"","culture":["Moonwood Vail"],"lineage":"","storyArc":"","backstory":"Kaelo became the independent king of Moonwood Vail and maintained the realm''s sovereignty against King Vorlag''s expansion and tyranny. He became the spiritual and martial anchor of his family while raising seven powerful werebeast children.","childhood":"","lifestyle":["Royal leadership","Martial training"],"storyRole":"Kaelo serves as the spiritual anchor of the Moonwood Vail royal family and the ruler who keeps outside tyranny from consuming his homeland.","birthplace":"","psychology":["Strong sense of responsibility","Protective of his family","Protective of his realm"],"motivations":["Protect his children","Protect Moonwood Vail","Preserve independence"],"personality":["Independent","Protective","Disciplined","Commanding","Resolute"],"voiceSpeech":["Authoritative","Measured","Direct"],"likesDislikes":"","majorLifeEvents":"Became King of Moonwood Vail\nDefended Moonwood Vail from King Vorlag"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/18527db0-a1c0-4b40-875d-8d911067a94a/portrait/1790360382571-king-kaelo-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"King Vorlag","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"","children":"Cosmo\nCalliope\nHuxleigh\nGemma\nPeregrine\nVenny’Claire\nVenny’Macon","siblings":"","worldConnections":"Moonwood Vail","relationshipNotes":"Kaelo is the father of seven werebeast children and serves as the central spiritual and martial authority of the royal family. His opposition to King Vorlag is rooted in protecting Moonwood Vail from Vorlag''s tyranny."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"a13abf6d-6ff2-42f4-a082-2ab7de1c32d4","realm_record_id":"63782818-208e-4e9b-a57c-9c33daba0589","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":null,"faction_record_id":"df5399c6-b9f2-4ad4-bfbe-d9bc5d7f426b"}', '2026-09-25 18:27:16.296349+00');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO studio_revisions (id, entity_type, entity_id, entity_label, changed_by, changed_by_email, snapshot, created_at) VALUES ('c3e19fab-edf4-4341-83dc-fb9a06a9e8f7', 'studio_characters', '2db0849d-a110-403b-a442-42bab2a31f6f', 'Gaius', 'db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745', 'Bryannaparker2521@gmail.com', '{"id":"2db0849d-a110-403b-a442-42bab2a31f6f","name":"Gaius","media":{"tbdFields":"","canonLocks":"","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/2db0849d-a110-403b-a442-42bab2a31f6f/portrait/1790360157683-gaius-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"","productionNotes":"","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/2db0849d-a110-403b-a442-42bab2a31f6f/reference/1790360166812-gaius-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/2db0849d-a110-403b-a442-42bab2a31f6f/alternate/1790360177853-gaius-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"","era":"500–1300 AD-inspired","name":"Gaius","race":"Elemental Dragon","alias":"The Sand Dragon","gender":"Male","titles":"Warden of the Wastes","subrace":"","summary":"Gaius is the Sand Dragon, born from the elemental union of Earth and Air. Calm, observant, and fiercely independent, he wanders the shifting deserts as a solitary warden. His power embodies erosion: the gradual reduction of even the strongest structures into countless moving grains.","heritage":"Indian + White","homeland":"","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"Warden of the Wastes","affiliation":"","apparentAge":"","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Shifting Sands","elementalHeritage":"Earth + Air"},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Physical attack evasion\nArea control\nAttrition combat\nEnvironmental manipulation\nArmor erosion\nBody reformation","weaknesses":"","combatStyle":["Patient","Defensive","Attrition-based","Area control","Indirect"],"limitations":["Extreme heat fuses sand into glass"],"powerSource":["Earth","Air","Sand"],"abilityNotes":"Gaius can disperse his physical body into sand, allowing conventional physical attacks to pass through him. Extreme heat can fuse his sand into glass, which he can manipulate into cages, barriers, jagged formations, or shattered projectiles. His sand combines Earth''s physical matter with Air''s velocity.","combatProfile":"Gaius avoids brute-force exchanges and gradually controls the battlefield through sandstorms, erosion, blindness, suffocation, and friction. He can dissolve into billions of grains to evade physical attacks and reform elsewhere. His high-speed sand can gradually strip protective material from targets.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Sand Dragon Form","primaryAbilities":"Sand Manipulation\nErosion Manipulation\nSand Dissolution\nSandstorm Generation","secondaryAbilities":"Mirage Creation\nFriction Manipulation\nSuffocation\nGlass Creation\nBody Reformation","signatureTechniques":"Mirage & Dissolution\nSuffocation & Friction\nGlass Creation","transformationDetails":"Gaius becomes a massive dragon composed of compressed golden-brown sand, silica, and quartz. His scales continuously grind and shift like moving dunes, while portions of his wings and tail dissolve into a perpetual sandstorm. His crystalline gold eyes remain completely solid and motionless while the rest of his body constantly shifts."},"is_public":false,"appearance":{"build":["Tall","Lean-muscular","Broad-shouldered"],"nails":"","eyeHex":["Golden Amber — #D89A32"],"height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":["Black — #171313"],"skinHex":["Warm Brown — #9A6848"],"eyeColor":["Golden amber"],"grooming":"Natural","skinTone":["Warm medium-brown"],"wardrobe":"Layered desert wraps\nFlowing drapes\nLoose trousers\nFace wraps\nLeather waist layers","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Tousled medium-length hair","accessories":"Gold earrings\nBronze arm cuffs\nLayered waist belts\nDesert face wrap","faceDetails":["Angular features","Defined jawline"],"hairTexture":["Wavy","Thick"],"colorPalette":"Sand — #D6B07A\nDune Gold — #C78B3B\nCopper — #9B5D2E\nDeep Brown — #4A3025\nDesert Cream — #E6D7BC","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Beige\nCopper\nDeep gold\nBrown","alternateForm":["Sand Dragon Form"],"clothingStyle":"Practical early-medieval desert attire designed for heat, wind, dust, and long-distance travel. Gaius favors loose layers that move naturally with the wind and can be rearranged for protection during sandstorms.","appearanceNotes":"His human design carries a distinctly nomadic desert silhouette with flowing layers and minimal rigid armor. His clothing should appear weathered and functional while retaining subtle gold ornamentation.","outfitMaterials":["Linen","Leather","Bronze","Gold"],"postureMovement":["Relaxed","Quiet","Fluid"],"signatureOutfit":"Layered desert wraps with flowing linen drapes, loose trousers, wrapped footwear, leather waist layers, and a protective face wrap. Gold and bronze accessories add restrained ornamentation without sacrificing mobility.","distinguishingFeatures":["Desert face wrap"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T17:33:26.092803+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T18:19:13.938897+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":["Guard the elemental borders","Preserve the wastes"],"beliefs":["Power does not require recognition","Change is inevitable"],"culture":"","lineage":"Primal Earth + Primal Air","storyArc":"","backstory":"Born to Terrax and Atherous, Gaius inherited the physical mass of Earth and the relentless velocity of Air. Their combined forces manifested as sand and erosion rather than solid stone or open wind. He eventually chose a solitary existence among the vast dunes, distancing himself from elemental family conflicts.","childhood":"","lifestyle":["Nomadic","Solitary","Desert wandering","Border guarding"],"storyRole":"Gaius serves as a quiet border guardian between the mortal world and the dangerous territories of the Primal Dragons. His isolation allows him to occupy a neutral position within volatile elemental family conflicts.","birthplace":"","psychology":["Values independence","Avoids family drama","Dislikes confinement","Prefers observation"],"motivations":["Protect the desert borders","Maintain independence","Prevent mortal trespassing"],"personality":["Calm","Observant","Independent","Reserved","Patient","Detached"],"voiceSpeech":["Quiet","Measured","Reserved"],"likesDislikes":["Likes solitude","Likes open deserts","Likes quiet","Dislikes loud egos","Dislikes confinement","Dislikes unnecessary conflict"],"majorLifeEvents":"Became Warden of the Wastes"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/2db0849d-a110-403b-a442-42bab2a31f6f/portrait/1790360157683-gaius-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"","worldConnections":"","relationshipNotes":""},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"f6cff800-4029-4f02-b391-098583082feb","realm_record_id":"48066562-cd1c-4b72-8c29-399594efad38","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"65ff1f49-c1fc-4599-93a6-fe6a49a4c4d5","faction_record_id":null}', '2026-09-25 18:27:16.828989+00');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO studio_revisions (id, entity_type, entity_id, entity_label, changed_by, changed_by_email, snapshot, created_at) VALUES ('19727dd9-1714-4160-9f24-9230a3a91f54', 'studio_characters', 'e229597e-305b-42fe-b232-1f78f3ac5735', 'Venny''Macon', 'db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745', 'Bryannaparker2521@gmail.com', '{"id":"e229597e-305b-42fe-b232-1f78f3ac5735","name":"Venny''Macon","media":{"tbdFields":"","canonLocks":"Rich warm brown skin\nDeep brown eyes\nBlack 4c hair\nWild untamed hairstyle\nSturdy muscular build\nNatural linen tunic\nBraided leather waist cord\nLeather sandals\nWhite werepanther form\nSilver left shoulder patch","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Official visual references include the solo human portrait, human production sheet, and white werepanther production sheet.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/e229597e-305b-42fe-b232-1f78f3ac5735/portrait/1790360114514-venny-macon-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nAlternate / True Form — Done","productionNotes":"Maintain the established anime design across future artwork. Human-form references establish his youthful face, warm brown skin, deep brown eyes, wild 4c hair, sturdy build, linen tunic, braided leather waist cord, and sandals. Werebeast references establish the large ghost-white werepanther design.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/e229597e-305b-42fe-b232-1f78f3ac5735/reference/1790360121111-venny-macon-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/e229597e-305b-42fe-b232-1f78f3ac5735/alternate/1790360126417-venny-macon-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"","era":"","name":"Venny''Macon","race":"Werebeast","alias":"","gender":"Male","titles":"","subrace":"Werepanther","summary":"Venny''Macon is one of King Kaelo''s children and the mirror counterpart of Venny''Claire. Quiet and reserved, he possesses immense strength that he has yet to fully understand or embrace. His uncertainty contrasts with the tremendous potential sleeping within him.","heritage":"Dire Wolf lineage","homeland":"Moonwood Vail","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"","affiliation":"","apparentAge":"","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Moonwood Vail","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Immense physical strength\nHigh durability\nPowerful build\nHeightened senses","weaknesses":"Lack of confidence\nUnrefined power\nOccasional clumsiness","combatStyle":["Strength-based","Instinctive","Power-focused"],"limitations":["Untapped potential","Reluctance to use full strength"],"powerSource":["Werepanther heritage","Dire Wolf lineage"],"abilityNotes":"His greatest limitation is not a lack of power but his uncertainty about using it. Much of his strength remains dormant or restrained.","combatProfile":"Venny''Macon possesses tremendous physical potential but has not fully learned to control or trust it. His werepanther form favors raw strength, durability, and powerful movement rather than refined technique.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Sudo Form\nWhite Werepanther Form","primaryAbilities":"Werepanther Transformation\nEnhanced Strength\nEnhanced Durability","secondaryAbilities":"Enhanced Senses\nEnhanced Speed\nEnhanced Agility","signatureTechniques":"","transformationDetails":"Venny''Macon''s full werebeast form is a magnificent white werepanther with a ghostly white, subtly shimmering coat. He becomes substantially larger and more muscular than a typical panther. His only visible dire wolf trait is a silver patch of fur on his left shoulder. Despite his noble and powerful appearance, his movements can be slightly clumsy and his demeanor remains timid and uncertain."},"is_public":false,"appearance":{"build":["Sturdy","Muscular","Broad-shouldered"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Deep brown"],"grooming":"Natural","skinTone":["Rich warm brown"],"wardrobe":"Knee-length tunic\nLeather sandals","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Wild and untamed","accessories":"Braided leather waist cord","faceDetails":["High cheekbones","Small symmetrical nose","Youthful features"],"hairTexture":["4c","Dense"],"colorPalette":"Warm Brown\nBlack\nNatural Linen\nLeather Brown\nGhost White\nSilver","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Natural linen\nLeather brown","alternateForm":["White Werepanther","Sudo Form"],"clothingStyle":"Simple, practical clothing suited to the climate and active life of Moonwood Vail.","appearanceNotes":"Venny''Macon closely mirrors Venny''Claire in facial structure, complexion, eyes, and hair. He is slightly taller and sturdier than his sister, with greater visible muscular development.","outfitMaterials":["Woven linen","Leather"],"postureMovement":["Reserved posture","Powerful movement"],"signatureOutfit":"Simple knee-length woven linen tunic secured with a braided leather cord and worn with leather sandals.","distinguishingFeatures":["Large wide-set eyes"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T17:41:56.33402+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T18:15:39.536338+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["His own potential"],"goals":"","beliefs":"","culture":["Moonwood Vail"],"lineage":"Dire Wolf and Werepanther","storyArc":"His arc follows the gradual awakening of his immense potential and his struggle to gain confidence in his own strength.","backstory":"","childhood":"","lifestyle":"","storyRole":"Venny''Macon embodies the sleeping giant: immense natural power restrained by uncertainty and reluctance. His development centers on learning to understand and accept the strength already within him.","birthplace":"","psychology":["Unsure of his potential","Reluctant to embrace his power"],"motivations":"","personality":["Quiet","Reserved","Timid","Uncertain","Kind-hearted"],"voiceSpeech":"","likesDislikes":"","majorLifeEvents":""},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/e229597e-305b-42fe-b232-1f78f3ac5735/portrait/1790360114514-venny-macon-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"King Kaelo","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Cosmo\nGemma\nCalliope\nHuxleigh\nPeregrine\nVenny''Claire","worldConnections":"Moonwood Vail","relationshipNotes":"Venny''Macon and Venny''Claire are mirror counterparts in appearance and temperament. Their shared features emphasize their connection, while his reserved uncertainty contrasts with her playful confidence."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"a13abf6d-6ff2-42f4-a082-2ab7de1c32d4","realm_record_id":"63782818-208e-4e9b-a57c-9c33daba0589","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"bbe46246-e94b-498d-9ab5-cae88e0804f7","faction_record_id":null}', '2026-09-25 18:27:18.065698+00');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO studio_revisions (id, entity_type, entity_id, entity_label, changed_by, changed_by_email, snapshot, created_at) VALUES ('cef536ea-e090-4391-bc59-45b6d6a5624d', 'studio_characters', 'eaaf8270-7b8d-4c38-99ee-3ac9d9b1b478', 'Venny''Claire', 'db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745', 'Bryannaparker2521@gmail.com', '{"id":"eaaf8270-7b8d-4c38-99ee-3ac9d9b1b478","name":"Venny''Claire","media":{"tbdFields":"","canonLocks":"Rich warm brown skin\nDeep brown eyes\nBlack 4c hair\nWild untamed hairstyle\nCompact agile build\nNatural linen dress\nBraided leather waist cord\nLayered jewelry\nLeather sandals\nBlack werepanther form\nSilver right hind leg patch","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Official visual references include the solo human portrait, human production sheet, and black werepanther production sheet.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/eaaf8270-7b8d-4c38-99ee-3ac9d9b1b478/portrait/1790359991558-venny-claire-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nAlternate / True Form — Done","productionNotes":"Maintain the established anime design across future artwork. Human-form references establish her youthful face, warm brown skin, deep brown eyes, wild 4c hair, compact build, linen dress, layered jewelry, braided leather waist cord, and sandals. Werebeast references establish the sleek black werepanther design.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/eaaf8270-7b8d-4c38-99ee-3ac9d9b1b478/reference/1790359997049-venny-claire-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/eaaf8270-7b8d-4c38-99ee-3ac9d9b1b478/alternate/1790360002404-venny-claire-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"","era":"","name":"Venny''Claire","race":"Werebeast","alias":"","gender":"Female","titles":"","subrace":"Werepanther","summary":"Venny''Claire is one of King Kaelo''s children and the mirror counterpart of Venny''Macon. Playful, carefree, and highly curious, she embraces movement and instinct with natural confidence. Her exceptional awareness and agility make her a swift, perceptive presence who treats the world around her as something to explore.","heritage":"Dire Wolf lineage","homeland":"Moonwood Vail","pronouns":"She/Her","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"","affiliation":"","apparentAge":"","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Moonwood Vail","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Exceptional agility\nHigh speed\nHeightened awareness\nFast reflexes\nFluid movement\nAcrobatic mobility","weaknesses":"","combatStyle":["Agile","Acrobatic","Instinctive","Evasive","Speed-focused"],"limitations":"","powerSource":["Werepanther heritage","Dire Wolf lineage"],"abilityNotes":"Her heightened senses provide a constant low-level stream of sensory information that guides her movements and gives her exceptional awareness of her surroundings.","combatProfile":"Venny''Claire relies on speed, agility, instinct, and constant sensory awareness rather than overwhelming physical force. Her compact werepanther form allows rapid directional changes, fluid evasive movement, and acrobatic attacks.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Sudo Form\nBlack Werepanther Form","primaryAbilities":"Werepanther Transformation\nEnhanced Agility\nEnhanced Speed\nHeightened Senses","secondaryAbilities":"Enhanced Awareness\nEnhanced Reflexes\nAcrobatic Movement\nStealth","signatureTechniques":"","transformationDetails":"Venny''Claire''s full werebeast form is a sleek black werepanther with a deep, inky coat that seems to absorb light. Her smaller, compact body is built for speed, stealth, and acrobatic agility. Her only visible dire wolf trait is a silver patch of fur on her right hind leg. She moves with fluid grace and retains her playful curiosity and exceptional awareness."},"is_public":false,"appearance":{"build":["Compact","Lean","Agile"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Deep brown"],"grooming":"Natural","skinTone":["Rich warm brown"],"wardrobe":"Sleeveless linen dress\nLeather sandals","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Wild and untamed","accessories":"Braided leather waist cord\nLayered necklaces\nBeaded jewelry\nGold earrings\nGold bracelet","faceDetails":["High cheekbones","Small symmetrical nose","Youthful features"],"hairTexture":["4c","Dense"],"colorPalette":"Warm Brown\nBlack\nNatural Linen\nLeather Brown\nGold\nSilver","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Natural linen\nLeather brown\nGold","alternateForm":["Black Werepanther","Sudo Form"],"clothingStyle":"Light, practical clothing that allows unrestricted movement and suits the climate of Moonwood Vail.","appearanceNotes":"Venny''Claire closely mirrors Venny''Macon in facial structure, complexion, eyes, and hair. She is smaller and more compact than her brother, with a lighter frame suited to speed, agility, and acrobatic movement.","outfitMaterials":["Woven linen","Leather","Beads","Metal"],"postureMovement":["Relaxed posture","Fluid movement","Light-footed"],"signatureOutfit":"Simple sleeveless woven linen dress secured with a braided leather waist cord and worn with leather sandals.","distinguishingFeatures":["Large wide-set eyes"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T17:42:10.890987+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T18:13:37.010421+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":"","beliefs":"","culture":["Moonwood Vail"],"lineage":"Dire Wolf and Werepanther","storyArc":"","backstory":"","childhood":"","lifestyle":"","storyRole":"Venny''Claire represents instinct, curiosity, and freedom of movement. Her natural confidence and heightened awareness contrast with Venny''Macon''s uncertainty, making the twins mirrors in appearance but opposites in how they approach their abilities.","birthplace":"","psychology":["Highly instinctive","Constantly aware","Lives in the moment"],"motivations":["Exploration","Curiosity"],"personality":["Playful","Carefree","Curious","Unserious","Mischievous","Observant"],"voiceSpeech":"","likesDislikes":"","majorLifeEvents":""},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/eaaf8270-7b8d-4c38-99ee-3ac9d9b1b478/portrait/1790359991558-venny-claire-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"King Kaelo","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Cosmo\nGemma\nCalliope\nHuxleigh\nPeregrine\nVenny''Macon","worldConnections":"Moonwood Vail","relationshipNotes":"Venny''Claire and Venny''Macon are mirror counterparts in appearance and temperament. Their shared features emphasize their connection, while her playful confidence and instinctive nature contrast with his reserved uncertainty."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"a13abf6d-6ff2-42f4-a082-2ab7de1c32d4","realm_record_id":"63782818-208e-4e9b-a57c-9c33daba0589","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"bbe46246-e94b-498d-9ab5-cae88e0804f7","faction_record_id":null}', '2026-09-25 18:27:18.723591+00');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO studio_revisions (id, entity_type, entity_id, entity_label, changed_by, changed_by_email, snapshot, created_at) VALUES ('9ae1a17d-ed71-4ede-9bc9-cf0dccd8aedd', 'studio_characters', '37c82673-519e-4ab9-bcea-ed600577eec0', 'Huxleigh', 'db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745', 'Bryannaparker2521@gmail.com', '{"id":"37c82673-519e-4ab9-bcea-ed600577eec0","name":"Huxleigh","media":{"tbdFields":"Pronunciation\nName meaning\nBirth date\nSpoiler level\nHeritage\nNationality\nOccupation\nHeight\nWeight\nDominant hand\nSignature outfit\nAccessories\nChildhood\nMajor life events\nGoals\nFears\nBeliefs\nStory arc\nWeapons\nSignature techniques\nWeaknesses\nLimitations\nPartner\nAllies\nRivals\nEnemies\nMentors","canonLocks":"Male\nMid 20s\nKing Kaelo''s son\nOne of seven children\nMoonwood Vail\nRich dark-brown skin\nAmber eyes\nShort thick 4C hair\nFaded sides\nLarge powerful build\nPolar bear / dire wolf hybrid\nWhite and silver beast fur\nGray beast undertones\nLong dire wolf snout\nControlled rage","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Existing human and werebeast artwork establishes Huxleigh''s visual identity. Generated image text, weapons, tattoos, abilities, measurements, affiliations, or clothing details not established in written canon should not be treated as canon.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nAlternate / True Form — Done\nFull-Body Front — Needed\nBack View — Needed\nLeft View — Needed\nRight View — Needed\nFace Reference — Done\nEye Reference — Done\nHair Reference — Done\nOutfit Breakdown — Needed\nExpression Sheet — Done\nCombat Reference — Needed","productionNotes":"Future artwork must preserve Huxleigh''s established anime/fantasy design. Human artwork should retain his dark-brown skin, amber eyes, short thick 4C curls with faded sides, rugged face, broad shoulders, and dense muscular build. Werebeast artwork must preserve the polar bear scale, dire wolf anatomy, white and silver fur with gray tones, elongated muzzle, and amber eyes.","referenceArtUrl":"","alternateFormUrl":""},"status":"draft","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"Mid 20s","era":"500–1300 AD-inspired","name":"Huxleigh","race":"Werebeast","alias":"","gender":"Male","titles":"","subrace":"Polar Bear / Dire Wolf Hybrid","summary":"Huxleigh is one of King Kaelo''s seven children and a powerful werebeast of Moonwood Vail. Large, broad-shouldered, and physically imposing, he carries himself with intimidating confidence and controlled strength. His gruff exterior and frequent scowl conceal a mischievous sense of humor. His werebeast form combines the immense scale of a polar bear with the lean musculature and long snout of a dire wolf.","heritage":"","homeland":"Moonwood Vail","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"","affiliation":"Moonwood Vail Royal Family","apparentAge":"Mid 20s","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Moonwood Vail","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Immense physical power\nDense musculature\nControlled brute force\nPhysical intimidation\nStrong self-control","weaknesses":"","combatStyle":["Brute force","Direct attacks","Heavy strikes","Controlled aggression"],"limitations":"","powerSource":["Werebeast physiology"],"abilityNotes":"No elemental magic, cryokinesis, magical weapons, or other supernatural abilities beyond his established werebeast traits have been confirmed.","combatProfile":"Huxleigh fights through overwhelming physical power and direct aggression while maintaining deliberate control. His tremendous weight and strength do not eliminate his grace or precision. His werebeast form greatly emphasizes close-range physical dominance.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Polar Bear / Dire Wolf Form","primaryAbilities":"Werebeast Transformation\nEnhanced Strength\nEnhanced Durability","secondaryAbilities":"Enhanced Senses","signatureTechniques":"","transformationDetails":"Huxleigh becomes a monstrous quadrupedal werebeast the size of an enormous polar bear. His form retains a lean, muscular dire wolf structure and long predatory snout beneath thick white, silver, and gray fur. His amber eyes remain prominent. His growl becomes a deep rumble, while his demeanor shifts toward controlled rage and immense brute force restrained by conscious will."},"is_public":false,"appearance":{"build":["Large","Broad-shouldered","Dense","Powerful","Muscular"],"nails":"","eyeHex":["Amber — #D88924"],"height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":["Black — #11100F"],"skinHex":["Dark Brown — #4A2B20"],"eyeColor":["Amber"],"grooming":"","skinTone":["Rich dark brown"],"wardrobe":"","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Short dense curls with faded sides","accessories":"","faceDetails":["Rugged handsome features","Strong jawline","Straight nose","Deep-set eyes"],"hairTexture":["4C","Thick","Tightly curled"],"colorPalette":"Dark Brown — #4A2B20\nBlack — #11100F\nAmber — #D88924\nPolar White — #EEEDE8\nSilver — #BFC2C5\nWolf Gray — #777A7D","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"","alternateForm":["Monstrous polar bear scale","Dire wolf physique","Long dire wolf snout","White fur","Silver fur","Gray undertones","Thick matted coat"],"clothingStyle":"","appearanceNotes":"Huxleigh''s human form should emphasize dense physical strength rather than exaggerated bulk. His werebeast form is enormous and quadrupedal, combining polar bear mass with the leaner muscular structure and elongated muzzle of a dire wolf. The hybrid silhouette must clearly communicate both bloodlines.","outfitMaterials":"","postureMovement":["Heavy","Direct","Controlled","Graceful","Self-assured"],"signatureOutfit":"","distinguishingFeatures":["Intimidating scowl","Powerful physique"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T18:35:44.284815+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T18:35:44.284815+00:00","is_complete":false,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":"","beliefs":"","culture":["Moonwood Vail"],"lineage":"King Kaelo''s bloodline","storyArc":"","backstory":"Huxleigh is one of King Kaelo''s seven children and belongs to the royal family of Moonwood Vail. Further personal history has not yet been established.","childhood":"","lifestyle":"","storyRole":"Huxleigh is a member of King Kaelo''s royal family and one of his seven children. His larger individual role remains unestablished.","birthplace":"Moonwood Vail","psychology":["Controlled aggression","Strong self-control","Hidden playful streak"],"motivations":"","personality":["Self-assured","Confident","Gruff","Intimidating","Controlled","Mischievous"],"voiceSpeech":["Deep","Gruff","Direct"],"likesDislikes":"","majorLifeEvents":""},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":2,"portrait_url":null,"relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"King Kaelo","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Cosmo\nGemma\nCalliope\nPeregrine\nVenny''Claire\nVenny''Macon","worldConnections":"Moonwood Vail","relationshipNotes":"Huxleigh is one of King Kaelo''s seven children. Individual relationship dynamics with his siblings have not yet been established."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"a13abf6d-6ff2-42f4-a082-2ab7de1c32d4","realm_record_id":"63782818-208e-4e9b-a57c-9c33daba0589","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":null,"faction_record_id":"ec408c98-c948-442c-9c14-74dd07dde097"}', '2026-09-25 18:35:48.079457+00');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO studio_revisions (id, entity_type, entity_id, entity_label, changed_by, changed_by_email, snapshot, created_at) VALUES ('1aa2ea48-b826-4fb6-b4be-21129825b338', 'studio_characters', '3fd4e4a6-bb47-4ed5-9d1f-cae8636d7a3a', 'Vorlenien "Vorlag" Hochmeister', 'db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745', 'Bryannaparker2521@gmail.com', '{"id":"3fd4e4a6-bb47-4ed5-9d1f-cae8636d7a3a","name":"Vorlenien \"Vorlag\" Hochmeister","media":{"tbdFields":"","canonLocks":"Black hair\nPiercing blue eyes\nTall build\nLean-muscular build\nBroad shoulders\nRegal presence","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done","productionNotes":"","referenceArtUrl":"","alternateFormUrl":""},"status":"draft","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"","era":"","name":"Vorlenien \"Vorlag\" Hochmeister","race":"","alias":"King","gender":"Male","titles":"King of Shadowfen","subrace":"","summary":"King Vorlenien \"Vorlag\" Hochmeister is the ruler of Shadowfen and wielder of the great runic magic inherited through his male bloodline. After his noble family was stripped of its status and later massacred in a fire secretly orchestrated by The Church, his dormant runic power awakened through overwhelming trauma. Raised and manipulated by The Church afterward, Vorlag pursued vengeance, power, and kingship while believing the prophecy surrounding his Runes of Dominion represented his true destiny.","heritage":"","homeland":"","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"Vorlag","occupation":"King","affiliation":"Shadowfen","apparentAge":"","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Shadowfen","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Exceptional intellect\nRunic power\nStrategic planning\nStrong will\nPolitical authority","weaknesses":"Unresolved trauma\nFear of helplessness\nProtective obsession\nSusceptibility to Church manipulation","combatStyle":"","limitations":["Runes were initially uncontrollable"],"powerSource":["Hochmeister bloodline","Great Runic Magic"],"abilityNotes":"The great runic magic passes through the male Hochmeister bloodline. Vorlag''s abilities remained dormant until the destruction of his family triggered their violent awakening at age twelve.","combatProfile":"Vorlag possesses powerful hereditary runic magic awakened through extreme trauma. His Runes of Dominion form the supernatural foundation of his authority and are central to the prophecy cultivated around him by The Church.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"","primaryAbilities":"Runic Magic\nRunes of Dominion","secondaryAbilities":"","signatureTechniques":"","transformationDetails":""},"is_public":false,"appearance":{"build":["Tall","Lean-muscular","Broad-shouldered"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Piercing blue"],"grooming":"","skinTone":["Pale"],"wardrobe":"","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"","accessories":"","faceDetails":["Sharp jawline","Angular features","Strong brows"],"hairTexture":"","colorPalette":"","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"","alternateForm":"","clothingStyle":"","appearanceNotes":"","outfitMaterials":"","postureMovement":["Regal","Controlled","Commanding"],"signatureOutfit":"","distinguishingFeatures":""},"created_at":"2026-09-25T18:39:22.116779+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T18:39:22.116779+00:00","is_complete":false,"origin_lore":{"fears":["Losing his family","Powerlessness","Failing to protect Theron","Losing control"],"goals":["Secure Shadowfen","Strengthen his rule","Fulfill his perceived destiny"],"beliefs":["Power ensures protection","Control prevents chaos","His runes mark his destiny","He is destined to rule"],"culture":"","lineage":"Hochmeister noble bloodline","storyArc":"Vorlag''s tragedy begins with a child desperate to protect his family and develops into a ruler who equates safety with absolute control. His vengeance and rise to power appear self-directed, but both were cultivated by The Church. The eventual truth behind his family''s massacre threatens the foundation of his identity, kingship, and belief in his destiny.","backstory":"At twelve, Vorlag returned with Vex, Corvin Sterling, and Alistar Vane to find the Hochmeister home engulfed in flames. Hearing his family trapped inside triggered the violent awakening of his inherited runic magic, forcing Vex to knock him unconscious before the uncontrolled eruption worsened. The massacre had secretly been engineered by The Church to awaken Vorlag''s power and advance a prophecy surrounding the Runes of Dominion. Church agents subsequently sheltered and trained him while directing his vengeance toward the nobles they had used as puppets. Vorlag eventually rose to kingship, married Isolde, established Shadowfen as his seat of power, and extended his influence into Ironspire Hold and the Lionheart Plains while remaining unaware of the full extent of The Church''s manipulation.","childhood":"Vorlag was born into a high-ranking noble family and displayed exceptional intellect from childhood. At age six, rival nobles stripped his family of its position and reduced them to commoners. He witnessed repeated humiliation and abuse directed toward his family and learned that openly resisting their aggressors could bring even greater retaliation.","lifestyle":["Royal governance","Military oversight","Runic training"],"storyRole":"Vorlag serves as the tyrannical King of Shadowfen while unknowingly remaining a central piece in The Church''s long-term plan. His rule, runic inheritance, and manipulated prophecy connect him to the artifact that Elias Thorne will eventually seek to protect.","birthplace":"","psychology":["Deep fear of helplessness","Obsessed with control","Protection through power","Unresolved family grief","Trauma-driven vigilance","Righteous self-justification"],"motivations":["Protect his family","Prevent future helplessness","Maintain absolute control","Fulfill the Dominion prophecy","Preserve Shadowfen"],"personality":["Intelligent","Calculating","Protective","Driven","Controlling","Ruthless","Traumatized","Determined","Suspicious"],"voiceSpeech":["Commanding","Controlled","Authoritative"],"likesDislikes":"","majorLifeEvents":"Born into House Hochmeister\nFamily stripped of noble status\nFamily reduced to commoners\nWitnessed repeated family abuse\nAttempted to defend his family\nHochmeister home burned\nFamily killed in the fire\nRunic magic awakened\nTaken in by The Church\nTrained by The Church\nHunted the responsible nobles\nFalsely accused of killing his family\nPursued the Dominion prophecy\nMarried Isolde\nBecame King\nEstablished Shadowfen"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":2,"portrait_url":null,"relationships":{"allies":"Count Vex\nLord Corvin Sterling\nLord Alistar Vane","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"Isolde","children":"Theron","siblings":"","worldConnections":"Shadowfen\nIronspire Hold\nLionheart Plains","relationshipNotes":"Vex, Corvin Sterling, and Alistar Vane were Vorlag''s closest childhood friends and remained central figures in his rise. Vex helped keep him level-headed through cynical distraction, Corvin brought humor during their childhood, and Alistar provided intellectual and physical motivation. The Church later positioned itself as Vorlag''s benefactor while secretly having engineered the destruction of his family."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":null,"realm_record_id":null,"workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":null,"faction_record_id":"74fb0163-f452-4f7e-a9ea-13c15bb960db"}', '2026-09-25 18:39:28.418552+00');
