 should retain his dark-brown skin, amber eyes, short thick 4C curls with faded sides, rugged face, broad shoulders, and dense muscular build. Werebeast artwork must preserve the polar bear scale, dire wolf anatomy, white and silver fur with gray tones, elongated muzzle, and amber eyes.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/37c82673-519e-4ab9-bcea-ed600577eec0/reference/1790363867954-huxleigh-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/37c82673-519e-4ab9-bcea-ed600577eec0/alternate/1790363873642-huxleigh-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"draft","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"Mid 20s","era":"500–1300 AD-inspired","name":"Huxleigh","race":"Werebeast","alias":"","gender":"Male","titles":"","subrace":"Polar Bear / Dire Wolf Hybrid","summary":"Huxleigh is one of King Kaelo''s seven children and a powerful werebeast of Moonwood Vail. Large, broad-shouldered, and physically imposing, he carries himself with intimidating confidence and controlled strength. His gruff exterior and frequent scowl conceal a mischievous sense of humor. His werebeast form combines the immense scale of a polar bear with the lean musculature and long snout of a dire wolf.","heritage":"","homeland":"Moonwood Vail","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"","affiliation":"Moonwood Vail Royal Family","apparentAge":"Mid 20s","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Moonwood Vail","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Immense physical power\nDense musculature\nControlled brute force\nPhysical intimidation\nStrong self-control","weaknesses":"","combatStyle":["Brute force","Direct attacks","Heavy strikes","Controlled aggression"],"limitations":"","powerSource":["Werebeast physiology"],"abilityNotes":"No elemental magic, cryokinesis, magical weapons, or other supernatural abilities beyond his established werebeast traits have been confirmed.","combatProfile":"Huxleigh fights through overwhelming physical power and direct aggression while maintaining deliberate control. His tremendous weight and strength do not eliminate his grace or precision. His werebeast form greatly emphasizes close-range physical dominance.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Polar Bear / Dire Wolf Form","primaryAbilities":"Werebeast Transformation\nEnhanced Strength\nEnhanced Durability","secondaryAbilities":"Enhanced Senses","signatureTechniques":"","transformationDetails":"Huxleigh becomes a monstrous quadrupedal werebeast the size of an enormous polar bear. His form retains a lean, muscular dire wolf structure and long predatory snout beneath thick white, silver, and gray fur. His amber eyes remain prominent. His growl becomes a deep rumble, while his demeanor shifts toward controlled rage and immense brute force restrained by conscious will."},"is_public":false,"appearance":{"build":["Large","Broad-shouldered","Dense","Powerful","Muscular"],"nails":"","eyeHex":["Amber — #D88924"],"height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":["Black — #11100F"],"skinHex":["Dark Brown — #4A2B20"],"eyeColor":["Amber"],"grooming":"","skinTone":["Rich dark brown"],"wardrobe":"","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Short dense curls with faded sides","accessories":"","faceDetails":["Rugged handsome features","Strong jawline","Straight nose","Deep-set eyes"],"hairTexture":["4C","Thick","Tightly curled"],"colorPalette":"Dark Brown — #4A2B20\nBlack — #11100F\nAmber — #D88924\nPolar White — #EEEDE8\nSilver — #BFC2C5\nWolf Gray — #777A7D","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"","alternateForm":["Monstrous polar bear scale","Dire wolf physique","Long dire wolf snout","White fur","Silver fur","Gray undertones","Thick matted coat"],"clothingStyle":"","appearanceNotes":"Huxleigh''s human form should emphasize dense physical strength rather than exaggerated bulk. His werebeast form is enormous and quadrupedal, combining polar bear mass with the leaner muscular structure and elongated muzzle of a dire wolf. The hybrid silhouette must clearly communicate both bloodlines.","outfitMaterials":"","postureMovement":["Heavy","Direct","Controlled","Graceful","Self-assured"],"signatureOutfit":"","distinguishingFeatures":["Intimidating scowl","Powerful physique"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T18:35:44.284815+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T19:18:48.059396+00:00","is_complete":false,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":"","beliefs":"","culture":["Moonwood Vail"],"lineage":"King Kaelo''s bloodline","storyArc":"","backstory":"Huxleigh is one of King Kaelo''s seven children and belongs to the royal family of Moonwood Vail. Further personal history has not yet been established.","childhood":"","lifestyle":"","storyRole":"Huxleigh is a member of King Kaelo''s royal family and one of his seven children. His larger individual role remains unestablished.","birthplace":"Moonwood Vail","psychology":["Controlled aggression","Strong self-control","Hidden playful streak"],"motivations":"","personality":["Self-assured","Confident","Gruff","Intimidating","Controlled","Mischievous"],"voiceSpeech":["Deep","Gruff","Direct"],"likesDislikes":"","majorLifeEvents":""},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/37c82673-519e-4ab9-bcea-ed600577eec0/portrait/1790363860158-huxleigh-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"King Kaelo","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Cosmo\nGemma\nCalliope\nPeregrine\nVenny''Claire\nVenny''Macon","worldConnections":"Moonwood Vail","relationshipNotes":"Huxleigh is one of King Kaelo''s seven children. Individual relationship dynamics with his siblings have not yet been established."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"a13abf6d-6ff2-42f4-a082-2ab7de1c32d4","realm_record_id":"63782818-208e-4e9b-a57c-9c33daba0589","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"54d24391-3ed4-445b-8bfe-8dba238fc8e0","faction_record_id":"ec408c98-c948-442c-9c14-74dd07dde097"}', '2026-09-25 19:18:49.758136+00');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO studio_revisions (id, entity_type, entity_id, entity_label, changed_by, changed_by_email, snapshot, created_at) VALUES ('eeb9c001-d5f4-4f28-b482-1e797b5bb6f6', 'studio_characters', '808d3a77-faab-458d-9d54-715ac887bb40', 'Sax', 'db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745', 'Bryannaparker2521@gmail.com', '{"id":"808d3a77-faab-458d-9d54-715ac887bb40","name":"Sax","media":{"tbdFields":"Birth date\nName meaning\nElemental heritage\nSubrace\nHeritage\nNationality\nCurrent residence\nWeight\nDominant hand\nParents'' names\nSiblings\nPartner","canonLocks":"Duskari\nMale\nMoonwoodvail origin\nSilas''s nephew\nCrimson Tide survivor\nCaptain Blackheart killed his family\nAzure Fleet destroyed his family\nVoodoo Roguery\nInvocation\nBiomancy\nTwin shadow daggers\nPurple eyes\nCornrow braids\nRed hair beads\nKaelen''s close friend\nZafir rivalry","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Future artwork must follow the established production sheet and full-body reference. Do not redesign Sax''s face, skin tone, eyes, hairstyle, physique, signature outfit, weapons, or primary palette.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nFull-Body Front — Done\nBack View — Done\nLeft View — Done\nRight View — Needed\nFace Reference — Done\nEye Reference — Needed\nHair Reference — Needed\nOutfit Breakdown — Done\nWeapon Reference — Done\nExpression Sheet — Done\nCombat Reference — Done","productionNotes":"The established Reference / Production Sheet is Sax''s primary visual canon. Preserve his dark skin, purple eyes, cornrow braids with red beads, lean muscular build, fur-trimmed vest, bone ornaments, deep-red sash, skull belt piece, Voodoo dolls, feather accents, and ornate twin daggers. Spiritual blade energy should remain dark purple and black.","referenceArtUrl":"","alternateFormUrl":""},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"19","era":"500–1300 AD-inspired","name":"Sax","race":"Duskari","alias":"The Voodoo Assassin","gender":"Male","titles":"The Voodoo Assassin","subrace":"","summary":"Sax is a young Duskari Voodoo Assassin raised in Moonwoodvail. After Captain Blackheart and the Azure Fleet slaughtered his family, his uncle Silas took him in and trained him in Voodoo. Sax weaponized those spiritual teachings into an aggressive assassination style driven by Invocation, Biomancy, shadow magic, and curses.","heritage":"","homeland":"Moonwoodvail","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"Assassin","affiliation":"Umbra Crew","apparentAge":"19","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"Twin Shadow Daggers\nVoodoo Dolls","strengths":"Extreme speed bursts\nFast reflexes\nClose-range combat\nSpiritual curses\nMental attacks\nHigh agility\nAssassination tactics","weaknesses":"Hot temper\nMental charms\nSpiritual manipulation\nImpulsiveness\nEmotional instability","combatStyle":["Voodoo Roguery","Dual-blade combat","Close-range assassination","High-speed movement","Mid-combat curse weaving","Shadow-enhanced strikes"],"limitations":["Sympathetic magic needs a connection","Blood curse requires prior contact","Spiritual Surge consumes life-force","Emotion disrupts concentration"],"powerSource":["Invocation","Biomancy","Spiritual energy","Ancestor spirits","Voodoo"],"abilityNotes":"Shadow-Cloaked Blades can temporarily disrupt Chronoessence conduits where Sax strikes. Grave Flashback overwhelms an enemy''s spiritual senses and forces traumatic memories or fears to the surface. Phantom Requiem: Thousand Curses summons spectral shadow-hands to restrain an enemy while Sax delivers a rapid sequence of shadow-cloaked strikes whose energy trails detonate in succession.","combatProfile":"Sax fights at close range rather than relying on stationary rituals. He channels Invocation through his spiritual techniques and Biomancy through his body, accelerating his muscles and nervous system with Spiritual Surge. His style combines rapid dual-blade attacks, shadow cloaking, sympathetic curses, and aggressive psychic assaults.","weaponDetails":"Sax dual-wields ornate curved daggers for rapid close-range attacks. He cloaks the blades in dark spiritual shadow capable of cutting physical targets and disrupting Chronoessence conduits. His blank Voodoo dolls become weapons for sympathetic curses after he obtains a physical connection to a target.","transformations":"","primaryAbilities":"Shadow-Cloaked Blades\nSpiritual Surge\nSympathetic Magic\nPsychomancy\nSpirit Channeling\nAncestor Communion","secondaryAbilities":"Sciomancy\nPhysical enhancement\nSpiritual tracking\nCurse weaving\nMental disruption","signatureTechniques":"Shadow-Cloaked Blades\nSpiritual Surge\nSympathetic Curse\nGrave Flashback\nPhantom Requiem: Thousand Curses","transformationDetails":""},"is_public":false,"appearance":{"build":["Lean","Athletic","Muscular","Toned"],"nails":"","eyeHex":["Vibrant Purple — #7B2CBF"],"height":"5''10\"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":["Black — #111111"],"skinHex":["Dark Brown — #70472F"],"eyeColor":["Vibrant purple"],"grooming":"Neat braids with rugged styling","skinTone":["Dark brown"],"wardrobe":"Fur-trimmed vest\nLoose dark trousers\nDeep-red sash\nArm wraps\nLeg wraps\nWrapped sandals","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Cornrow braids with loose front braids and red beads","accessories":"Animal-tooth necklace\nTooth earrings\nRed beads\nUpper-arm bands\nAnimal-skull belt buckle\nTwo Voodoo dolls\nFeather bundle\nSpiritual charms","faceDetails":["Sharp eyebrows","Angular features","Confident grin","Small sharp fangs"],"hairTexture":["Tightly coiled"],"colorPalette":"Dark Brown — #70472F\nBlack — #111111\nDeep Red — #711B1B\nBone Ivory — #DDD2BE\nSpirit Purple — #7B2CBF\nTeal — #285B69","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Dark brown\nBlack\nDeep red\nBone ivory\nTeal","alternateForm":"","clothingStyle":"Rugged Moonwoodvail assassin attire designed for unrestricted movement. Bone, teeth, beads, feathers, leather, and spiritual charms reinforce his Rootworker influence while preserving a fast close-combat silhouette.","appearanceNotes":"Sax''s established design uses a lean muscular silhouette with minimal armor for speed. His skull belt ornament, Voodoo dolls, bone jewelry, feather accents, braided hairstyle, and twin ornate daggers are major visual identifiers.","outfitMaterials":["Leather","Fur","Cloth","Bone","Feathers","Cord","Metal"],"postureMovement":["Predatory","Agile","Fast","Combat-ready"],"signatureOutfit":"Sax wears an open sleeveless brown vest with fur trim, bone fasteners, loose dark trousers, arm wraps, rugged leg wraps, and a deep-red waist sash. An animal skull decorates his belt, two Voodoo dolls hang at his waist, and a feather bundle adds red, white, and teal accents.","distinguishingFeatures":["Small fangs","Red hair beads","Tooth earrings","Bone ornaments"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T18:35:28.28368+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T18:35:28.28368+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["Losing another family","Failing his loved ones","Mental manipulation"],"goals":["Kill Captain Blackheart","Protect the Umbra Crew","Master Voodoo Roguery"],"beliefs":["Respect the ancestors","Protect those you love","Loyalty demands action"],"culture":["Moonwoodvail","Rootworking","Voodoo","Ancestor communion","Crossroads spirituality"],"lineage":"Duskari","storyArc":"Sax begins as a young fighter consumed by vengeance against Captain Blackheart. Training under Silas gradually forces him to refine his volatile emotions into disciplined spiritual combat. His bond with Kaelen and the Umbra Crew gives him people to protect beyond the family he lost.","backstory":"Captain Blackheart and the Azure Fleet slaughtered Sax''s family during the Crimson Tide Tragedy. Sax survived because his mother hid him during the raid. His uncle Silas took custody of him and attempted to teach him the healing and protective traditions of Voodoo, but Sax''s desire for vengeance led him to weaponize those teachings into an assassination-focused fighting style.","childhood":"Sax grew up in Moonwoodvail alongside Asha, Keno, Mali, and Rico. Their tight-knit peer group gave him a strong sense of community despite his naturally hot temper. His childhood ended violently when Captain Blackheart and the Azure Fleet attacked his coastal village.","lifestyle":["Aggressive combat training","Spiritual practice","Target hunting","Traveling with the Umbra Crew"],"storyRole":"Sax is an emotional lightning rod within the early Umbra Crew and one of Kaelen''s first true friends. His clear desire for vengeance contrasts with Kaelen''s uncertainty about his missing memories. Sax''s hatred of corruption pushes the group forward while his fierce loyalty helps keep Kaelen grounded.","birthplace":"Moonwoodvail","psychology":["Trauma-driven anger","Survivor grief","Vengeance fixation","Protective attachment","Emotionally reactive"],"motivations":["Avenge his family","Protect Kaelen","Destroy the Azure Fleet","Master his spiritual power"],"personality":["Hot-tempered","Fiercely loyal","Brash","Impulsive","Protective","Vengeful","Determined","Gritty","Competitive"],"voiceSpeech":["Blunt","Sharp","Emotionally charged","Quick-tempered"],"likesDislikes":["His crew","Challenges","Spicy food","Silas''s old stories","Dislikes vampires","Dislikes betrayal","Dislikes corrupt authority","Hates being tricked"],"majorLifeEvents":"Childhood in Moonwoodvail\nCrimson Tide Tragedy\nFamily slaughtered\nSurvived the Azure Fleet raid\nTaken in by Silas\nTrained in Voodoo\nBegan hunting Captain Blackheart\nMet Kaelen at Sunstone Coast\nJoined forces with Kaelen\nReturned to Moonwoodvail with Kaelen\nTrained under Silas"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":null,"relationships":{"allies":"Kaelen Thorne\nAsha\nKeno\nMali\nUmbra Crew","rivals":"Zafir\nRico","enemies":"Captain Blackheart\nAzure Fleet","mentors":"Silas\nMama Eve","parents":"","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"","worldConnections":"Moonwoodvail\nSunstone Coast\nAethelgard","relationshipNotes":"Silas is Sax''s uncle and primary Voodoo mentor, taking custody of him after the destruction of his family. Kaelen becomes Sax''s first close companion after they fight Blackheart''s thugs together near the Sunstone Coast, and Sax becomes fiercely protective of him. Sax has an explosive rivalry with Zafir, whose teasing and mini-form antics regularly provoke him. Asha, Keno, Mali, and Rico belong to Sax''s childhood Moonwoodvail peer group."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"baaf3d0d-afe5-4ad3-92e2-14dbe7cbd5e0","realm_record_id":"63782818-208e-4e9b-a57c-9c33daba0589","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"0b04c5a0-22fd-4442-a86d-eea0aeb15514","faction_record_id":"bd19189f-d8ba-4190-af7a-4c9df16e50c9"}', '2026-09-25 19:19:44.298001+00');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO studio_revisions (id, entity_type, entity_id, entity_label, changed_by, changed_by_email, snapshot, created_at) VALUES ('f63f9ab4-edb8-45ea-b7a0-5ae96724a37b', 'studio_characters', 'b317848b-4cba-46fa-8807-4c9ffd26392e', 'Herabelle', 'db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745', 'Bryannaparker2521@gmail.com', '{"id":"b317848b-4cba-46fa-8807-4c9ffd26392e","name":"Herabelle","media":{"tbdFields":"Birth date\nExact age\nBirthplace\nHomeland\nCurrent residence\nParents\nSiblings\nLineage\nHeritage\nNationality\nHeight\nWeight\nDominant hand\nPartner status\nFormal affiliation","canonLocks":"Name is Herabelle\nFemale\nHuman\nBlonde hair\nGreen eyes\nBeautiful appearance\nDevoted to Alistair\nSoul-Tether\nHeart-Seeker\nWeapons forged by Alistair\nCarries her weapons with love","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Established artwork includes character portraits, a full-body combat design, visual production material, Soul-Tether and Heart-Seeker references, combat imagery, and promotional artwork. Future artwork must preserve the established blonde-haired, green-eyed Herabelle design.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nFull-Body Front — Done\nBack View — Done\nLeft View — Needed\nRight View — Needed\nFace Reference — Done\nEye Reference — Done\nHair Reference — Needed\nOutfit Breakdown — Done\nWeapon Reference — Done\nExpression Sheet — Done\nCombat Reference — Done","productionNotes":"Preserve Herabelle''s established blonde hair, green eyes, fair complexion, feminine face, slender athletic build, and neutral medieval-fantasy combat clothing. Soul-Tether and Heart-Seeker must follow their established visual references. Her design should emphasize beauty and elegance while allowing her obsessive combat persona to create a dramatic visual contrast.","referenceArtUrl":"","alternateFormUrl":""},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"","era":"500–1300 AD-inspired","name":"Herabelle","race":"Human","alias":"","gender":"Female","titles":"The Shadow of the Forge\nDevoted Protector","subrace":"","summary":"Herabelle is a beautiful, highly devoted protector whose loyalty to Alistair borders on worship. She serves as the finesse beside his overwhelming force, using speed, precision, and chained weaponry to control threats around him. Her affection becomes dangerous when jealousy or perceived threats to Alistair overwhelm her judgment.","heritage":"","homeland":"","pronouns":"She/Her","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"Protector","affiliation":"","apparentAge":"Young adult","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"Soul-Tether\nHeart-Seeker","strengths":"Speed\nAgility\nPrecision\nWeapon control\nBattlefield control\nProtective instinct","weaknesses":"Obsessive attachment\nJealousy\nEmotional instability\nPossessiveness","combatStyle":["Macabre Acrobat","Chain combat","Acrobatic movement","Precision strikes","Protective interception","Battlefield herding"],"limitations":["Emotion can override judgment","Overprotective of Alistair"],"powerSource":["Combat training","Alistair-forged weapons"],"abilityNotes":"Her combat choreography should appear graceful and rhythmic even at maximum aggression. Soul-Tether creates broad sweeping movements and unusual attack angles, while Heart-Seeker provides compact precision at close range.\n\nHerabelle is her canonical name. Do not use Lyra.","combatProfile":"Herabelle fights through finesse rather than overwhelming force. Soul-Tether controls distance and enemy movement while Heart-Seeker handles close-range precision attacks. She uses fluid acrobatics to herd enemies toward Alistair''s attacks and will physically intercept threats directed at him.","weaponDetails":"Soul-Tether is a long chained weapon crafted by Alistair for battlefield control. Its chain, crescent cutting head, and weighted component allow Herabelle to bind, trip, slow, and manipulate enemy movement. Heart-Seeker is a jagged, ultra-sharp serrated blade forged from Alistair''s kinetic-absorbing metal for close-range precision and dismantling. Herabelle carries both weapons with intense affection because Alistair made them.","transformations":"","primaryAbilities":"Chain Weapon Mastery\nBlade Mastery\nAcrobatic Combat\nEnemy Restraint\nPrecision Dismantling","secondaryAbilities":"Battlefield Control\nRapid Repositioning\nProtective Interception\nTarget Tracking","signatureTechniques":"Kinetic Synchronization\nSadist''s Grace\nHuman Shield","transformationDetails":""},"is_public":false,"appearance":{"build":["Slender","Athletic","Agile"],"nails":"","eyeHex":["Green — #6F8F65"],"height":"","makeup":["Subtle eye definition","Natural lips"],"weight":"","hairHex":["Blonde — #D8B985"],"skinHex":["Fair — #E8C9B8"],"eyeColor":["Green"],"grooming":"Feminine and carefully maintained","skinTone":["Fair"],"wardrobe":"Neutral combat attire\nDark leather armor\nIvory underlayers\nTall leather boots\nFingerless gloves","hairColor":["Blonde"],"hairStyle":"Long flowing blonde hair","accessories":"Forge-soot vial necklace\nLeather belts\nMetal chains\nForge-inspired jewelry","faceDetails":["Soft feminine features","Refined jawline","Delicate nose","Expressive eyes"],"hairTexture":["Soft","Lightly tousled"],"colorPalette":"Ivory — #E6DDD0\nCharcoal — #211F1E\nBlack — #0D0D0E\nLeather Brown — #49372C\nSteel — #A9B3BA\nRune Blue — #8DD9ED","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Ivory\nCharcoal\nBlack\nDark brown\nSteel","alternateForm":"","clothingStyle":"Herabelle wears elegant medieval-fantasy combat clothing built around neutral colors and dark leather. Fitted protection, layered fabrics, belts, chains, and subtle gothic detailing complement her graceful fighting style without restricting movement.","appearanceNotes":"Herabelle initially looks like an exceptionally beautiful and seemingly ordinary blonde human woman. Her green eyes become noticeably softer and gain a subtle twinkle when she looks at Alistair. Her combat expressions create a sharp contrast with her otherwise graceful appearance.","outfitMaterials":["Leather","Linen","Metal","Chain","Lace"],"postureMovement":["Graceful","Fluid","Acrobatic","Predatory"],"signatureOutfit":"A fitted neutral-toned fantasy combat ensemble with an ivory underlayer, dark leather corsetry, layered fabric, belts, straps, gloves, and tall boots. The silhouette remains feminine and elegant while allowing unrestricted acrobatic movement.","distinguishingFeatures":["Intense sanpaku gaze","Softened gaze around Alistair","Elegant combat silhouette"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T18:32:15.632468+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T18:32:15.632468+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["Losing Alistair","Separation from Alistair"],"goals":["Keep Alistair safe","Remain useful to Alistair","Fight beside Alistair"],"beliefs":["Alistair is extraordinary","His creations are sacred","Protection proves devotion"],"culture":"","lineage":"","storyArc":"Herabelle''s arc explores the dangerous boundary between devotion, possession, and protection. Her loyalty makes her an invaluable defender, but her distorted interpretation of Alistair''s affection can become unstable whenever she believes their bond is threatened.","backstory":"Herabelle became deeply devoted to Alistair and established herself as his protector. Her attachment developed beyond ordinary loyalty, causing her to treat his craftsmanship, words, and gifts with almost sacred reverence. She quietly handles perceived threats around him rather than burdening him with every confrontation.","childhood":"","lifestyle":["Stays near Alistair","Maintains her weapons","Watches for threats","Preserves forge keepsakes"],"storyRole":"Herabelle serves as the graceful but dangerous shadow beside Alistair. Where his forgecraft and kinetic force dominate openly, she uses speed, precision, chains, and close-range attacks to control threats before they can reach him.","birthplace":"","psychology":["Idealizes Alistair","Misreads affection","Possessive attachment","Threat fixation","Extreme devotion"],"motivations":["Protect Alistair","Remain beside Alistair","Preserve his creations","Eliminate threats"],"personality":["Devoted","Protective","Possessive","Obsessive","Elegant","Patient","Ruthless","Jealous"],"voiceSpeech":["Soft","Melodic","Tender with Alistair","Cold toward threats","Guttural when enraged"],"likesDislikes":["Alistair''s craftsmanship","Alistair''s attention","Forge keepsakes","Protecting Alistair","Disrespect toward Alistair","Threats toward Alistair"],"majorLifeEvents":"Became Alistair''s devoted protector\nReceived Soul-Tether\nReceived Heart-Seeker"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":null,"relationships":{"allies":"Alistair","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"","worldConnections":"","relationshipNotes":"Alistair is the center of Herabelle''s devotion. She views him and his forgecraft with almost religious reverence and frequently interprets practical praise or affection from him as something deeper. Soul-Tether and Heart-Seeker are especially precious to her because Alistair forged them."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"c68d60d1-883a-4683-8000-a9cd9d0d4d2a","realm_record_id":null,"workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":null,"faction_record_id":null}', '2026-09-25 19:20:51.413733+00');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO studio_revisions (id, entity_type, entity_id, entity_label, changed_by, changed_by_email, snapshot, created_at) VALUES ('bf25d6ac-bb72-453e-a432-ccf27940a205', 'studio_characters', '27d2993d-dc47-4027-9d2d-d0daed6b43c2', 'Peregrine', 'db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745', 'Bryannaparker2521@gmail.com', '{"id":"27d2993d-dc47-4027-9d2d-d0daed6b43c2","name":"Peregrine","media":{"tbdFields":"Age\nBirth date\nPronunciation\nName meaning\nExact height\nExact weight\nDominant hand\nMother\nPartner\nAllies\nRivals\nEnemies\nMentors\nExact dagger design\nExact illusion techniques\nIllusion limitations","canonLocks":"Male\nHe/Him\nKing Kaelo''s son\nOne of seven siblings\nMoonwood Vail\nWerebeast\nWarm caramel skin\nLoose 4C afro\nLithe slender build\nShortest older sibling\nIllusion mastery\nDeception mastery\nDaggers\nFox-Dire Wolf form\nSmaller werebeast form\nRed and caramel fur\nDark grey paws","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Existing artwork establishes Peregrine''s human appearance, fantasy clothing, daggers, expressions, and Fox-Dire Wolf werebeast design. Future artwork should preserve the established visual continuity.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nAlternate / True Form — Done\nFull-Body Front — Done\nBack View — Done\nLeft View — Needed\nRight View — Needed\nFace Reference — Done\nEye Reference — Done\nHair Reference — Done\nOutfit Breakdown — Done\nWeapon Reference — Done\nExpression Sheet — Done\nCombat Reference — Done","productionNotes":"Maintain Peregrine''s established anime/fantasy design across future artwork. His human form must remain lithe, slender, warm caramel-skinned, sharp-featured, and characterized by loose 4C hair. His werebeast form must remain smaller than his siblings'' forms and preserve its red, caramel, and dark grey coloration.","referenceArtUrl":"","alternateFormUrl":""},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"","era":"500–1300 AD-inspired","name":"Peregrine","race":"Werebeast","alias":"","gender":"Male","titles":"Prince of Moonwood Vail","subrace":"Fox-Dire Wolf Werebeast","summary":"Peregrine is a lithe and cunning prince of Moonwood Vail whose strengths lie in agility, deception, and illusion. Smaller than his older siblings, he developed a competitive streak and a constant need to prove that he is every bit as dangerous. He carries himself with sly confidence, natural elegance, and a sharp awareness of his surroundings.","heritage":"","homeland":"Moonwood Vail","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"Prince","affiliation":"Moonwood Vail Royal Family","apparentAge":"Young adult","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Moonwood Vail","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"Daggers","strengths":"Agility\nSpeed\nCunning\nDeception\nObservation\nIllusion\nQuick thinking","weaknesses":"Smaller stature\nCompetitive pride\nNeed to prove himself","combatStyle":["Agile","Deceptive","Evasive","Dagger-based","Misdirection-focused","Precision-focused"],"limitations":["Less physically imposing","Illusion limits unestablished"],"powerSource":["Werebeast nature","Illusion mastery"],"abilityNotes":"Peregrine is established as a master of deception and illusion. Exact illusion techniques, ranges, costs, and restrictions have not yet been established.","combatProfile":"Peregrine favors speed, misdirection, illusions, and precision over direct contests of strength. His quick movements and deceptive tactics keep opponents uncertain of his true position and intentions. His smaller werebeast form further emphasizes agility rather than overwhelming physical power.","weaponDetails":"Peregrine carries daggers at his waist for fast, precise attacks that complement his agile fighting style. Their exact design and number have not been established.","transformations":"Fox-Dire Wolf Werebeast Form","primaryAbilities":"Illusion\nDeception","secondaryAbilities":"Enhanced agility\nEnhanced senses\nRapid movement\nStealth\nSharp observation","signatureTechniques":"","transformationDetails":"Peregrine''s werebeast form is approximately the size of a large fox, making him smaller than his siblings'' werebeast forms. It combines fox-like proportions with powerful dire wolf limbs and a dense coat. His fur blends vibrant reds and warm caramel, shifting to dark grey around his dire wolf-like paws. His sharp, intelligent eyes and agile movements preserve his cunning personality in this form."},"is_public":false,"appearance":{"build":["Lithe","Slender","Lean","Agile"],"nails":"","eyeHex":["Amber Brown — #A8662B"],"height":"Medium height","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":["Black — #15120F"],"skinHex":["Warm Caramel — #A96845"],"eyeColor":["Amber-brown"],"grooming":"Neat and stylish","skinTone":["Warm caramel"],"wardrobe":"Short linen tunic\nFitted trousers\nLeather ankle ties\nWide leather belt\nShort shoulder cloak","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Loose stylish afro","accessories":"Metal cloak brooch\nLeather belt\nDagger sheaths","faceDetails":["Sly fox-like face","Sharp features","Expressive brows"],"hairTexture":["4C"],"colorPalette":"Black — #151515\nDark Brown — #3A281E\nWarm Caramel — #A96845\nWarm Red — #9A3F27\nDark Grey — #3B3A3A","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Black\nCharcoal\nDark brown","alternateForm":["Fox-Dire Wolf Werebeast Form"],"clothingStyle":"Peregrine favors dark, lightweight garments designed for maximum movement and stealth. His clothing remains practical while retaining the understated refinement expected of Moonwood Vail nobility.","appearanceNotes":"Peregrine is the most lithe and slender of his brothers and the shortest of his older siblings. His silhouette should emphasize speed and agility rather than physical bulk. His sharp face, loose 4C afro, sly smirk, and confident bearing should remain consistent across artwork.","outfitMaterials":["Dark linen","Leather","Metal"],"postureMovement":["Natural elegance","Confident swagger","Quick movements","Graceful movements","Purposeful movements"],"signatureOutfit":"A tightly woven dark linen tunic cut short for unrestricted movement with period-appropriate trousers secured by leather ties at the ankles. A wide leather belt holds his daggers, while a short dark linen cloak is draped over one shoulder and secured with a metal brooch.","distinguishingFeatures":["Sly smirk","Fox-like features"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T18:30:14.787091+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T18:30:14.787091+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["Being dismissed as weak","Being overshadowed"],"goals":["Master illusion","Remain unpredictable","Prove his capability"],"beliefs":["Cunning can defeat strength","Size does not determine danger"],"culture":["Moonwood Vail","Werebeast royalty"],"lineage":"Moonwood Vail Royal Family","storyArc":"Peregrine''s established internal conflict centers on his need to prove that his smaller stature does not make him less dangerous or capable than his siblings. Further story developments remain unestablished.","backstory":"Peregrine grew into a clever and agile member of Moonwood Vail''s royal family. His smaller stature became both an insecurity and a driving force, pushing him toward mastery of illusion and deception. He learned to make unpredictability, speed, and intelligence more dangerous than brute strength.","childhood":"Growing up smaller than his older siblings contributed to Peregrine''s competitive nature and strong need to prove himself. Rather than relying on physical size, he developed cunning, agility, wit, and deception as his defining strengths.","lifestyle":["Practices agility","Practices deception","Maintains mobility-focused clothing"],"storyRole":"Peregrine represents cunning, deception, and agility among King Kaelo''s children. His smaller stature distinguishes him from his physically larger siblings and encourages him to approach danger through intelligence, misdirection, and speed.","birthplace":"Moonwood Vail","psychology":["Short guy complex","Needs to prove himself","Dislikes underestimation","Highly competitive"],"motivations":["Prove his worth","Outsmart stronger opponents","Match his siblings"],"personality":["Cunning","Competitive","Confident","Sly","Clever","Observant","Free-spirited","Prideful","Witty"],"voiceSpeech":["Sharp wit","Confident delivery","Playful taunting"],"likesDislikes":["Likes competition","Likes clever victories","Likes proving himself","Dislikes being underestimated","Dislikes size comparisons"],"majorLifeEvents":""},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":null,"relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"King Kaelo","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Cosmo\nGemma\nCalliope\nHuxleigh\nVenny''Claire\nVenny''Macon","worldConnections":"Moonwood Vail","relationshipNotes":"Peregrine is one of King Kaelo''s seven children. His smaller stature compared with his older siblings contributes to his competitive personality and desire to prove himself."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"a13abf6d-6ff2-42f4-a082-2ab7de1c32d4","realm_record_id":"63782818-208e-4e9b-a57c-9c33daba0589","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"615fa3ab-4f1d-47f0-b4f3-5e94e4fbf5fe","faction_record_id":"ec408c98-c948-442c-9c14-74dd07dde097"}', '2026-09-25 19:21:50.098084+00');
